  "question": {
    "text": "An artillery piece which consistently shoots its shells with the same muzzle speed has a maximum range <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>. To hit a target which is <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> from the gun and on the same level, the angle of &nbsp;elevation &nbsp;of the gun should be"
  },
